        ['A rectangle has length (x + 4) cm and width (x − 1) cm and its area is less than 50 cm². Find the range of values of x.', ['Inequality', 'Solve', 'Condition', 'Answer'], '(x + 4)(x − 1) < 50, x² + 3x − 54 < 0, (x + 9)(x − 6) < 0, so −9 < x < 6. Since the width must be positive, x > 1, hence 1 < x < 6.', 'Compare your answer with the model answer and tick off the points you made.', 5, 'theory', 8],
